  "title": "Chicken Empanadas",
  "description": "Chef John shows us how to make perfectly baked chicken empanadas in this recipe, packed with flavor thanks to diced tomatoes, poblanos, and spices.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-06-07T09:00:00-04:00",
